__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.venv/
dist/
build/
*.egg-info/
*.sqlite3
# Local scratch output (databases, ad-hoc reports) is ignored, but recorded
# evaluation and integration results are tracked: EVALS.md requires a baseline
# that is never silently replaced, which only works if it is committed.
#
# artifacts/agent-baseline/ added 2026-08-28, authorized in #48. It holds the
# frozen real-model transcripts, the capture records that attest them, and the
# subject manifest - the most literal case of the rule above, and the one that
# had no exception. Without it BASELINE-AGENT-001 would have written its outputs,
# reported them committed, and had git drop them silently: a single unrepeatable
# run surviving on one machine and nowhere else.
artifacts/*
!artifacts/README.md
!artifacts/evals/
!artifacts/integration/
!artifacts/agent-baseline/
samples/*.bin
samples/*.hex
samples/*.srec

